WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.167
Keep the job folder, permit and terms.

00:00:03.867 --> 00:00:08.267
Open the job. The folder is on the job. Let's open one.

00:00:08.767 --> 00:00:17.867
The job folder. The paper cover sheet, kept up to date by itself from the contract, payments and invoices. You tick the rest here.

00:00:18.367 --> 00:00:28.567
Filled in by itself. Start date, contract emailed, signed contract, the ST-8, each payment and the final bill tick themselves as they happen.

00:00:29.067 --> 00:00:36.500
Ticked by you. Account tagged, the permit and the final inspection are filled in with the pencil (Edit the folder).

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:45.400
Contract and payments. The contract plus change orders, then each payment: paid (and how), part paid or not paid yet.

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:50.500
Print the cover sheet. Prints it like the paper one, for the job file.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:54.967
Edit the folder. Dates the system can't know go in here.

00:00:55.467 --> 00:00:59.033
Account tagged. Tick it once the account is tagged.

00:00:59.533 --> 00:01:09.800
Permit needed. Then the job can't start until the permit is approved: a red Permit hold banner on the job (Mark the permit approved) and a lock on the board.

00:01:10.300 --> 00:01:21.100
Time and materials. Bills the crew's on-site man-hours. A "Bill tracked time" card then shows: enter the rate per man-hour, then Make the invoice (a line per day).

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:29.033
Emailed contract on. Blank = the day the estimate went out. Type a date if the contract went another day.

00:01:29.533 --> 00:01:32.733
Permit #. The township's permit number.

00:01:33.233 --> 00:01:39.533
Permit fee. Goes on the final invoice, or press Bill now on the folder to bill it on its own.

00:01:40.033 --> 00:01:47.567
Permit status. To apply for, Applied, Approved, Inspection booked, Passed, Failed inspection or Not needed.

00:01:48.067 --> 00:01:53.233
Municipality. Long Beach Twp, Stafford, Ship Bottom …

00:01:53.733 --> 00:01:58.767
Permit dates. Applied for on, Approved on, and the next inspection.

00:01:59.267 --> 00:02:03.633
Inspection notes. What the inspector said, or what is booked.

00:02:04.133 --> 00:02:13.467
Final inspection. Its date and your initials. A complete permit job without one shows "Call for the final inspection" on the folder.

00:02:13.967 --> 00:02:16.733
Notes. Anything else for the folder.

00:02:17.233 --> 00:02:21.700
Save the folder. Save folder keeps it. The tour doesn't press it.

00:02:22.200 --> 00:02:26.867
Close the form. The x closes the form without saving anything.

00:02:27.367 --> 00:02:39.600
Contract terms. The payment schedule in words. On a capital improvement an ST-8 box shows: no sales tax, so upload the customer's signed NJ ST-8 there.

00:02:40.100 --> 00:02:52.167
Tell the customer their date. Auto follows the type of work. On or Off sets it for this job: On sends a "you're on the schedule" email when the date is set or moves. It saves at once.

00:02:52.667 --> 00:03:00.633
Work weekends?. Switch on Saturdays or Sundays for this job. It saves at once and the scheduled days move to match.

00:03:01.133 --> 00:03:06.733
That's it. You can play this tour in the app any time: press Help, and ask in your own words.
